{"3161310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hela: of Mice & Magic", "steam_appid": 3161310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Heroes Embark On A Big Adventure In 'Hela: of Mice and Magic'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world through the eyes of a brave little mouse in this enchanting 3D co-op adventure. Explore breathtaking landscapes inspired by Northern Sweden, solve puzzles, and be a force for good in a land where heartwarming storytelling and the beauty of nature intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the world begins to fall out of tune and the kind witch who has long protected it grows ill, her familiars embark on a journey to restore harmony to the land and help her shoulder the burden she can no longer carry alone. Playing as a tiny, intrepid mouse, you’ll venture into the wild, gather ingredients, brew magical potions, and lend a helping paw wherever it’s needed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/ae0d4f72036f72876fb4e52b73fc123d.poster.avif?t=1787230672\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/ae0d4f72036f72876fb4e52b73fc123d.webm?t=1787230672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/ae0d4f72036f72876fb4e52b73fc123d.mp4?t=1787230672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey Together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hela: of Mice and Magic encourages you to work hand-in-hand to overcome the challenges that lie ahead. Play solo, with a friend in local split-screen, or with up to four players in online co-op as you explore vibrant vistas together, from rugged mountains trails, through magical forests, to tranquil lakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when playing alone, you can experience the full adventure thanks to the Shade System, which lets you create magical copies of yourself to help solve puzzles and interact with the world. However you choose to play, the entire journey is open to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/71aa6c489f1152f7ee69a58a2791ab2f.poster.avif?t=1787230672\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/71aa6c489f1152f7ee69a58a2791ab2f.webm?t=1787230672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/71aa6c489f1152f7ee69a58a2791ab2f.mp4?t=1787230672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Freely</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Hela is built to be explored at your own pace. Wander off the beaten path, experiment with playful interactions, and uncover story fragments scattered across the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this enchanting world as you glide through the air, collect items, solve puzzles, and find creative ways to navigate a world where everyday objects become grand adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/69053f706fd5519c9b399f893baf37dc.poster.avif?t=1787230672\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/69053f706fd5519c9b399f893baf37dc.webm?t=1787230672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/69053f706fd5519c9b399f893baf37dc.mp4?t=1787230672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Froggy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your magical froggy backpack is your constant companion. Use Froggy to interact with the world, collect resources, solve environmental puzzles, and discover playful new ways to explore the landscape around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/06bef51becc2ff85670452e1862ddee1.poster.avif?t=1787230672\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/06bef51becc2ff85670452e1862ddee1.webm?t=1787230672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/06bef51becc2ff85670452e1862ddee1.mp4?t=1787230672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Discover:</strong> Traverse an expansive, lovingly crafted region inspired by Scandinavia, full of magical forests, tranquil lakes, and rugged mountains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Backpack:</strong> Use your trusty backpack to interact with the world, collect resources, and solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Engage with objects that behave realistically, adding a layer of immersion to your magical excursions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living Playground: </strong>Step into a world designed for playful exploration, filled with interactive objects, winding paths, and challenges that reward curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Solving:</strong> Challenge your mind with engaging puzzles that blend seamlessly with the story, enriching your journey with rewarding challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Small Acts, Big Heart: </strong>Kindness is its own reward. Find meaning in small acts of kindness and the quiet warmth they bring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Together:</strong> Experience the journey solo or together with friends through local split-screen or online modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/a7ff0ad64c18aef4b68f6c996b72ca7e.poster.avif?t=1787230672\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/a7ff0ad64c18aef4b68f6c996b72ca7e.webm?t=1787230672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161310/extras/a7ff0ad64c18aef4b68f6c996b72ca7e.mp4?t=1787230672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Heroes Embark On A Big Adventure In 'Hela: of Mice and Magic'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world through the eyes of a brave little mouse in this enchanting 3D co-op adventure. Explore breathtaking landscapes inspired by Northern Sweden, solve puzzles, and be a force for good in a land where heartwarming storytelling and the beauty of nature intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the w